#: kcmfontinst/FontList.cpp:925
msgid ""
"<p>This list shows your installed fonts. The fonts are grouped by family, and the number in square brackets represents the number of styles in which the family is available. e.g.</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li>Times [4]"
"<ul>"
"<li>Regular</li>"
"<li>Bold</li>"
"<li>Bold Italic</li>"
"<li>Italic</li>"
"</ul>"
"</li>"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Disse List wiest Dien installeert Schriftoorden. Se sünd na Familien tohoopstellt, de eckige Klemmen wiest de Tall vun Stilen, in de dat de Familie gifft. Bispill:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li>Times [4]"
